      "description": "The current editing mode has a gold bottom mark.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-modes\" aria-label=\"Editor modes\"><button aria-pressed=\"true\">Inspect</button><button>Transfer</button><button>Divide</button><button>Merge</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-modes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:3px;padding:3px;background:var(--color-app-bg);border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:4px}.ds-modes button{font-family:Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;font-size:12px;min-height:34px;padding:0 5px;color:var(--color-text);background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 150ms ease,color 150ms ease}.ds-modes button:hover{background:var(--color-surface-muted);border-color:var(--color-primary)}.ds-modes button:active{background:var(--color-primary-soft)}.ds-modes button[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{background:var(--color-primary-soft);box-shadow:inset 0 -2px var(--color-primary);color:var(--color-primary-hover)}.ds-modes button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--color-focus);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
