  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Political Command — map only",
    "overview": "The map uses muted country colors, a dark slate-blue sea, strong country borders, and uppercase country names. The user selected Political Command from working map previews. The map is drawn with SVG and code. This change adds no shipping raster images.\n\nThe editor keeps its existing dark surfaces, warm gold actions, serif titles, and compact controls. The map direction does not replace the editor identity. The map must remain easy to read while the user changes countries and regions.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Strong country borders with less visible region borders at low zoom.",
      "Six default country colors with exact custom scenario colors.",
      "Uppercase sans-serif country names without map flags.",
      "Existing dark editor with warm gold controls."
    ],
